stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Working: input received
    Working --> AwaitingAnswer: information missing
    AwaitingAnswer --> Working: answer received
    Working --> Done: result produced
    Done --> Working: follow-up
    Done --> [*]: session ends
    AwaitingAnswer --> [*]: session reset
    Idle --> [*]: session reset
    note right of AwaitingAnswer
        Real user input required.
        Never auto-advance.
    end note
    note right of Done
        Reset clears all state for the session.
    end note
